WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.364
Start an empty MagicSchool assessment. (3× speed)

00:00:00.364 --> 00:00:09.486
Enter the approved brief and short source summary; PDF upload unavailable. (3× speed)

00:00:09.486 --> 00:00:13.184
Read the complete approved brief and short chapter summary.

00:00:13.184 --> 00:00:13.721
Generate five questions from the approved short summary. (3× speed)

00:00:13.721 --> 00:00:14.458
MagicSchool generates the original five-question assessment. (4× speed)

00:00:14.458 --> 00:00:20.516
Inspect the generated questions and their actual answer key.

00:00:20.516 --> 00:00:20.557
Request the missing explanations while preserving all five questions.

00:00:20.557 --> 00:00:27.104
Focus the answer field

00:00:27.104 --> 00:00:27.493
Generate the complete assessment with rationales

00:00:27.493 --> 00:00:28.114
Generate the missing answer rationales as a separate native response. (4× speed)

00:00:28.114 --> 00:00:31.058
Read question 1 and its answer options.

00:00:31.058 --> 00:00:33.865
Read question 2 and its answer options.

00:00:33.865 --> 00:00:36.654
Read question 3 and its answer options.

00:00:36.654 --> 00:00:39.418
Read question 4 and its answer options.

00:00:39.418 --> 00:00:42.183
Read question 5 and its answer options.

00:00:42.183 --> 00:00:45.850
Check each correct answer against its explanation.

00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:45.955
Export the native question set and its explanations together.

00:00:45.955 --> 00:00:46.360
Open the native assessment export options

00:00:46.360 --> 00:00:49.412
Export the actual assessment thread as Word

00:00:49.412 --> 00:00:50.226
Include the original questions and the separate rationales

00:00:50.226 --> 00:00:50.667
Download the original complete assessment thread
